# Database dumps taken before hand-run production writes (see
# apps/ingestion/README.md). These contain the real User/Session/Account
# tables — email addresses and live Google OAuth access/refresh tokens — so
# committing one means rotating every credential in it.
# Deliberately not a blanket *.sql: that would silently swallow new Prisma
# migrations under apps/api/prisma/migrations/.
*.dump
*-backup-*.sql
*-backup-*.sql.gz

.vite/
coverage/
coverage-report/
test-report.json

